{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1428","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Fruit Sequences"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Zookeeper is buying a carton of fruit to feed his pet wabbit. The fruits are a sequence of apples and oranges, which is represented by a binary string $$$s_1s_2\\ldots s_n$$$ of length $$$n$$$. $$$1$$$ represents an apple and $$$0$$$ represents an orange."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Since wabbit is allergic to eating oranges, Zookeeper would like to find the longest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"contiguous"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sequence of apples. Let $$$f(l,r)$$$ be the longest "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"contiguous"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sequence of apples in the substring $$$s_{l}s_{l+1}\\ldots s_{r}$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Zookeeper find $$$\\sum_{l=1}^{n} \\sum_{r=l}^{n} f(l,r)$$$, or the sum of $$$f$$$ across all substrings."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ $$$(1 \\leq n \\leq 5 \\cdot 10^5)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The next line contains a binary string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$ $$$(s_i \\in \\{0,1\\})$$$ "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer: $$$\\sum_{l=1}^{n} \\sum_{r=l}^{n} f(l,r)$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n0110\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n1101001\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n30\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12\n011100011100\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n156\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test, there are ten substrings. The list of them (we let $$$[l,r]$$$ be the substring $$$s_l s_{l+1} \\ldots s_r$$$):"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1,1]$$$: 0 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1,2]$$$: 01 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1,3]$$$: 011 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[1,4]$$$: 0110 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2,2]$$$: 1 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2,3]$$$: 11 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2,4]$$$: 110 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[3,3]$$$: 1 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[3,4]$$$: 10 "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4,4]$$$: 0 "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The lengths of the longest contiguous sequence of ones in each of these ten substrings are $$$0,1,2,2,1,2,2,1,1,0$$$ respectively. Hence, the answer is $$$0+1+2+2+1+2+2+1+1+0 = 12$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1428F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1428/problem/F"}